 "せんずり": "عَادَة سِرِّيَّة (manual erotic stimulation of the genitals) / اِسْتِمْنَاء (manual erotic stimulation of the genitals)  [(male) masturbation]",
 "せんずる": "دُمَّل, خُرَاج (A localized accumulation of pus in the skin, resulting from infection.) / غَلَيَان, غَلْي (The point at which fluid begins to change to a vapour; the boiling point.) / غَلَّى (To cook in boiling water.)  [to boil]",
