 "ぜんご": "ذَهَابًا وَإِيَابًا (From one place to another and back again.)  [back and forth]\nمثال: 彼は首を前後に振りました。\n→ He shook his head back and forth. / [before and after] / حَوْلَ (Forming a circle or closed curve containing (something).) / حَوْلَ (Following a path which curves near an object, with the object on the inside of t) / بِالْقُرْب, قُرْبَ (Near; in the vicinity of; approximately.) / مَوْجُود (Alive; existing.)  [around]\nafter a quantity, age, time, etc.\nمثال: 日本のＯＤＡは返済期間３０年、利率２％前後という条件の緩い円借款が大部分を占める。\n→ Japan's ODA largely consists of concessionary yen credit repayable in 30 years, carrying an interest rate of 2% or so. / تَرْتِيب, نِظَام (Arrangement, disposition, or sequence.) / أَمْر, حُكْم (A command.) / طَلَب (A request for some product or service; a commission to purchase, sell, or supply) / جَمَاعَة (A group of religious adherents, especially monks or nuns, set apart within their) / وِسَام (A decoration, awarded by a government, a dynastic house, or a religious body to ) / رُتْبَة (A category in the classification of organisms, ranking below class and above fam) / أَمَرَ (To issue a command to; to charge.) / طَلَبَ, حَجَزَ (To request some product or service; to secure by placing an order.)  [order]\nمثال: 倒置法は言葉の前後を入れ替えることにより文章を強調する効果があります。\n→ Anastrophe, by switching around words, has the effect of emphasizing text.",
