 "そこ": "هُنَاكَ (In or at a place or location (stated, implied or otherwise indicated) that is pe)  [there (place relatively near listener)]\nمثال: １時間以内にそこに着くでしょう。\n→ We'll arrive there within an hour. / هُنَاكَ (In or at a place or location (stated, implied or otherwise indicated) that is pe)  [there (place just mentioned)] / آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then (of some incident just spoken of)] / مَن, اَلْمَرْء (Anyone, one; an unspecified individual or group of individuals (as subject or ob) / ـكُم, ـكُنَّ (A dummy pronoun used in certain constructions, usually with verbs of receiving ()  [you]",
