 "そこぬけ": "[bottomless (bucket, etc.)] / الْأُقْصَى, الْأَبْعَد (Of a place, the most remote, farthest or outermost.) / شَدِيد (In the greatest or highest degree; intense.) / غَيْر اِعْتِيَادِيّ (Excessive, or far beyond the norm.) / خَطِير (Drastic, or of great severity.) / مُتَطَرِّف (Of sports, difficult or dangerous; performed in a hazardous environment.) / أَخِير (Ultimate, final or last.)  [extreme] / غَيْر مُبَالِي (Not giving sufficient attention or thought, especially concerning the avoidance )  [careless]\nمثال: 彼は底抜けの馬鹿だ。\n→ He's an absolute fool. / [extremely heavy drinker]",
