 "そのうえ": "إِضَافَةً عَلى ذٰلِكَ (Also; as well; besides.)  [in addition]\nمثال: この本はおもしろい、その上、非常にためになる。\n→ This book is interesting and, what is more, very instructive. / أَعْلَى (Physically over; on top of; worn on top of, said of clothing.) / فَوقَ (In or to a higher place; higher than; on or over the upper surface.) / شَمَالِيّ (Farther north than.) / أَعْلَى (Higher than; superior to in any respect; surpassing; higher in measure, degree, ) / على (In preference to.)  [above (which)]\nمثال: その上さらに５ドル払った。\n→ I paid five dollars in addition.",
