 "そのうち": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: そのうち一緒に仕事ができるといいなと思っています。\n→ Hope we can work together soon. / [of the previously mentioned ; of that number]",
 "そのうちに": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: 「そのうちに、あなたのところにお邪魔してもいいですか」「どうぞ、どうぞ」\n→ \"Do you mind if I call on you sometime?\" \"No, not at all.\"",
 "そのおり": "آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then]",
 "そのかみ": "كَان يَامَا كَان (A long time ago; at some time in the past (a traditional beginning of children's)  [once upon a time]",
 "そのかわり": "بَدَلاً مِن (In the place of something (usually mentioned earlier); as a substitute or altern)  [instead]\nمثال: 映画に行きたいような気がしない。その代わり散歩をしよう。\n→ I don't feel like going to the movies. Let's take a walk instead.",
 "そのけ": "مِثْلِيَّة, مِثْلِيَّة جِنْسِيَّة (Sexual activity with a person of the same sex, sometimes (potentially offensive))  [homosexuality]",
 "そのこと": "لِكَيْ, أَنْ (Introducing a subordinate clause that expresses an aim, purpose, or goal (“final) / ذٰلِكَ, ذَاكَ (The (thing, person, idea, etc) indicated or understood from context, especially ) / ذَاكَ (that thing) / ذٰلِكَ (that thing) / تِلْكَ (that thing) / اَلَّذِي (which) / اَلَّتِي (which) / اَلَّذِينَ (which)  [that]",
 "そのころ": "آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then]\nمثال: そのころ彼はいつも飲んでばかりいた。\n→ He was always drinking in those days.",
 "そのご": "أَخِير, بَعْدَ ذٰلِك (At a later or succeeding time; after that;)  [afterwards]\nそのご is more formal\nمثال: その後の話はご存じでしょう。\n→ You know the rest of the story.",
 "そのじつ": "فِي الْحَقِيقَة (Actually; in truth; de facto.)  [in fact]",
 "そのすじ": "[that field] / [the authorities (esp. the police)] / يَاكُوزَا, يَاكُوزَا (A Japanese organized crime gang.)  [the yakuza]",
 "そのた": "رَاحَة, اِسْتِرَاحَة (Relief from work or activity by sleeping; sleep.) / اِسْتَرَاحَ (To be based on; to rely on something for proof or explanation) / بَاقِيَّة (remainder) / أَثَارَة (remainder)  [the rest]\nそのた is the more common reading when written\nمثال: 何本か花がある。一本は赤、もう一本は白で、その他は黄だ。\n→ There are several flowers. One is red, another is white, and the others are yellow. / إِضَافَةً عَلى ذٰلِكَ (Also; as well; besides.)  [in addition (to that)]\nمثال: 私はその他の計画を思い付かない。\n→ I can't think of any other plan. / وَهٰكَذَا, وَهَلُمَّ جَرًّا (Indicates that a list continues in a similar manner.)  [and so forth]",
 "そのため": "وَعَلَيْهِ, وَمِنْ ثَمَّ (As a result; therefore, for this reason.)  [hence]\nمثال: そのため、派遣労働者は劣悪な労働条件の下で働いている。\n→ For that reason, temporary workers are working under inferior conditions.",
 "そのとき": "آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then]\nمثال: そのとき彼らはたんぽぽをつみとって、彼らの耳につけました。\n→ Then they picked dandelions and put them in their ears.",
 "そののち": "أَخِير, بَعْدَ ذٰلِك (At a later or succeeding time; after that;)  [afterwards]\nそのご is more formal\nمثال: その後の話はご存じでしょう。\n→ You know the rest of the story.",
 "そのはず": "طَبْعًا (Naturally; as would be expected; for obvious reasons, obviously.)  [of course]",
 "そのはんめん": "من ناحية أخرى, من جهة أخرى (From another point of view.)  [on the other hand]\nمثال: それは値段は安いが、その反面品質がよくない。\n→ It is cheap, but on the other hand it is not good.",
 "そのば": "هُنَاكَ (In or at a place or location (stated, implied or otherwise indicated) that is pe)  [there]\nمثال: 彼の演説はその場にふさわしいものだった。\n→ His speech was suitable for the occasion. / فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]\nas 〜で\nمثال: 私はその場ですぐに賃金を払った。\n→ I paid his wages on the spot.",
 "そのばかぎり": "مُؤَقَّت (Existing only for a short time or short times.)  [temporary]\nمثال: その場限りのことを言う。\n→ He says things on the spur of the moment.",
 "そのほう": "لِكَيْ, أَنْ (Introducing a subordinate clause that expresses an aim, purpose, or goal (“final) / ذٰلِكَ, ذَاكَ (The (thing, person, idea, etc) indicated or understood from context, especially ) / ذَاكَ (that thing) / ذٰلِكَ (that thing) / تِلْكَ (that thing) / اَلَّذِي (which) / اَلَّتِي (which) / اَلَّذِينَ (which)  [that] / مَن, اَلْمَرْء (Anyone, one; an unspecified individual or group of individuals (as subject or ob) / ـكُم, ـكُنَّ (A dummy pronoun used in certain constructions, usually with verbs of receiving ()  [you]\nreferring to someone of equal or lower status",
 "そのほか": "رَاحَة, اِسْتِرَاحَة (Relief from work or activity by sleeping; sleep.) / اِسْتَرَاحَ (To be based on; to rely on something for proof or explanation) / بَاقِيَّة (remainder) / أَثَارَة (remainder)  [the rest]\nそのた is the more common reading when written\nمثال: 何本か花がある。一本は赤、もう一本は白で、その他は黄だ。\n→ There are several flowers. One is red, another is white, and the others are yellow. / إِضَافَةً عَلى ذٰلِكَ (Also; as well; besides.)  [in addition (to that)]\nمثال: 私はその他の計画を思い付かない。\n→ I can't think of any other plan. / وَهٰكَذَا, وَهَلُمَّ جَرًّا (Indicates that a list continues in a similar manner.)  [and so forth]",
 "そのほかに": "غَيْر, آخَر (Other; in addition to previously mentioned items.) / وَإِلَا (For otherwise; or else.)  [else]\nمثال: その他にポケットに何を持っていますか。\n→ What else do you have in your pocket?",
 "そのまさかだ": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly]\noften in resp. to まさか...",
 "そのまま": "كَمَا هُوَ, كَمَا هِيَ (as it is; in its present unchangeable state or condition, especially as a contra)  [as is]\nمثال: ドアをそのままにしておいてはいけません。\n→ The door must not be left open. / [just like ; extremely similar] / فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]",
 "そのまんま": "كَمَا هُوَ, كَمَا هِيَ (as it is; in its present unchangeable state or condition, especially as a contra)  [as is]\nمثال: ドアをそのままにしておいてはいけません。\n→ The door must not be left open. / [just like ; extremely similar] / فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]",
