 "そば": "جَانِب (A bounding straight edge of a two-dimensional shape.) / جَانِب (One half (left or right, top or bottom, front or back, etc.) of something or som) / صَفْحَة (One surface of a sheet of paper (used instead of \"page\", which can mean one or b)  [the side (of something)]\nمثال: あの窓のそばの机は使うな。\n→ Don't use the desk by that window. / مَا أَن, حَالَمَا (At the moment when; immediately (after); instantly; directly.)  [as soon as]\nafter the attributive form of a verb; as ...〜から",
 "そばかす": "نَمَش (A small brownish or reddish pigmentation spot on the surface of the skin.)  [freckle]\nمثال: 家では赤味がかった髪とそばかすのせいで、母が侮蔑を込めて「にんじん」と名付け、皆にもそう呼ばせています。\n→ At home, because of his reddish hair and freckles, his mother scornfully named him \"carrot\" and had everybody else call him that. / [buckwheat chaff]\norig. meaning",
 "そばから": "مَا أَن, حَالَمَا (At the moment when; immediately (after); instantly; directly.)  [as soon as]\nafter verb",
 "そばきり": "سُوبَا, سُوبَا (A Japanese buckwheat noodle.)  [soba]",
 "そばだつ": "بُرْج (tall, narrow structure)  [to tower]",
 "そばだてる": "سُلَالَة (Race; lineage, pedigree.)  [to strain (one's ears, eyes)]\nمثال: 私の声を聞きつけて、私の犬は耳をそばだてた。\n→ At the sound of my voice, my dog pricked up his ears.",
 "そばづかえ": "خادمَة (A female performer in professional wrestling, acting as either a manager or pers)  [valet]",
