 "それみたことか": "قُلْتُ لَكَ ذٰلِكَ, قُلْتُ لَكِ ذٰلِكَ (Used to remind someone that they were already warned by the speaker or writer th)  [I told you so]\nused when someone ignores your advice and ultimately fails at something",
 "それも": "عِلَاوَة عَلَى ذٰلِكَ, أَضِف إِلَى ذٰلِك (In addition to what has been said.)  [moreover] / [even so ; and yet]",
 "それもこれも": "كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]\nمثال: うるさいなっ！少しの頭痛くらい我慢しろ。余は魔力がすっからかんだ。それもこれも姫のせいだぞ。\n→ Shurrup! Don't make such a fuss over a little headache. I'm flat out of magical power - this is all your fault!",
