 "それらしい": "هَٰكَذَا, كَذَا (Used adverbially or adjectivally to indicate similitude, similarity, equivalent )  [(something) like that]\nمثال: チャットルームで知り合った人をパブで探したが、それっぽい人はいなかった。\n→ I searched at the pub for the person I had met online, but there was nobody who looked like that. / أَقْنَعَ (To make someone believe, or feel sure about something, especially by using logic)  [convincing]",
 "それる": "[to turn away ; to bear off] / ضَلَّ (To develop bad habits; to behave improperly or illegally.) / ضَلَّ (To come to believe an untruth.)  [to go astray]\nمثال: 本題からそれないようにしましょう。\n→ Let's not deviate from the subject.",
