 "それ故に": "إِذَنْ, لِذٰلِكَ (Consequently, by or in consequence of that or this cause; referring to something)  [therefore]\nمثال: 学寮長のベイカーさんは、それゆえに自分の所有する小さい車のために、駐車場に特別なスペースを設けた。\n→ The head of the college, Miss Baker, had a special place in the car park for her small car.",
