 "それ見たことか": "قُلْتُ لَكَ ذٰلِكَ, قُلْتُ لَكِ ذٰلِكَ (Used to remind someone that they were already warned by the speaker or writer th)  [I told you so]\nused when someone ignores your advice and ultimately fails at something",
 "それ見た事か": "قُلْتُ لَكَ ذٰلِكَ, قُلْتُ لَكِ ذٰلِكَ (Used to remind someone that they were already warned by the speaker or writer th)  [I told you so]\nused when someone ignores your advice and ultimately fails at something",
 "そろ": "كَانَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ هُوَ, هِيَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ (As an intransitive lexical verb:)  [to be]\nauxiliary used in place of ある after で or に when forming a copula / فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do]\nauxiliary used in place of ます",
 "そろい": "وَضَع (To put (something) down, to rest.) / غَرَبَ (Of a heavenly body, to disappear below the horizon of a planet, etc, as the latt) / مَجْمُوعَة, طَقْم (A matching collection of similar things. (Note the similar meaning in Etymology ) / مَجْمُوعَة (Set theory.)  [set]\nمثال: あのチームはつわものぞろいだ。\n→ That team has nothing but strong players. / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]\nOften as ぞろい",
 "そろいぶみ": "[ritual stamping in the ring] / تَشْكِيلَة (Collectively, the members of a team.)  [lineup]",
 "そろい踏み": "[ritual stamping in the ring] / تَشْكِيلَة (Collectively, the members of a team.)  [lineup]",
 "そろう": "[to be complete ; to be all present]\nمثال: この手袋は両方がそろっていない。\n→ Their gloves are not in pairs. / مُبَارَاة (Any contest or trial of strength or skill, or to determine superiority.) / شَحّاطَة, شَخَّاطَة (Synonym of fuse, a long wick used to transfer flame to an explosive device.)  [to match] / جَمَعَ (To bring parts of a whole closer.)  [to gather]\nمثال: この図書館には中国語の本がかなりそろっている。\n→ This library has a large collection of Chinese books.",
 "そろえ": "تَرْتِيب (The act of arranging.)  [arrangement] / [counter for sets]",
 "そろえる": "جَمَعَ (To gather together; amass.)  [to collect]\nمثال: そのアパートはビクトリア朝風の家具を揃えてあった。\n→ The apartment was furnished in the Victorian style. / رَتَّبَ (To set up; to organize; to put into an orderly sequence or arrangement.)  [to arrange]\nمثال: パーティーには食べ物や飲物が豊富に揃えて有った。\n→ There was food and drink in abundance at the party. / مُبَارَاة (Any contest or trial of strength or skill, or to determine superiority.) / شَحّاطَة, شَخَّاطَة (Synonym of fuse, a long wick used to transfer flame to an explosive device.)  [to match]\nمثال: その提案に口をそろえて反対を唱えた。\n→ We said in unison that we didn't agree to the suggestion.",
 "そろそろ": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: そろそろ寝る時間だぞ。\n→ It's time you went to bed. / بِبُطْء (At a slow pace.)  [slowly] / قَد, مِنْ قَبْلُ (Prior to some specified time, either past, present, or future; by this time; pre) / لقد (So soon.)  [already]\nused exhortatively or to express impatience",
 "そろっと": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nNiigata dialect",
 "そろばん": "مِعَد, مِعْدَاد (A device used for performing arithmetical calculations; (rare) a table on which ) / نَاصِيَة (The uppermost portion of the capital of a column immediately under the architrav)  [abacus] / حَسْب, مُحَاسَبَة (The act or process of calculating.)  [calculation (esp. of profit and loss)]",
 "そろばんがあう": "[the figures add up ; the calculation comes out right] / دَفَعَ, خَلَّصَ (To give money or other compensation to in exchange for goods or services.) / معاش, أجر (Money given in return for work; salary or wages.)  [to pay]",
 "そろばんが合う": "[the figures add up ; the calculation comes out right] / دَفَعَ, خَلَّصَ (To give money or other compensation to in exchange for goods or services.) / معاش, أجر (Money given in return for work; salary or wages.)  [to pay]",
 "そろばんずく": "مُرْتَزِق, مُؤْجِر (A person employed to fight in an armed conflict who is not a member of the state) / مُؤْجِر (Motivated by personal gain.)  [mercenary]",
