 "たごん": "أَفْشَى (To make public or known; to communicate to the public; to tell (information, esp)  [divulging (a secret)]\nمثال: 彼は他言しないと約束した。\n→ He promised not to tell.",
 "たごんむよう": "السر في بئر (Indicates that something is a secret and not to be divulged.)  [mum's the word]",
