 "たさつ": "قَتْلٌ عَمْدٌ (An act of killing a person unlawfully, especially with predetermination.) / قَتَلَ (deliberately kill)  [murder]",
 "たし": "ملحق (An extension to a document or publication that adds information, corrects errors) / مُكَمِّل (A vitamin, herbal extract, or chemical compound ingested to meet dietary deficie)  [supplement]",
 "たしか": "أَكِيد (Physically secure and certain, non-failing, reliable.) / مُتَأَكِّد (Certain in one's knowledge or belief.) / طَبْعًا, أَكِيد (Yes; of course.)  [sure]\nمثال: 彼が間違っているのは確かです。\n→ It is certain that he is wrong. / مَوْثُوق (Suitable or fit to be relied on; worthy of dependence, reliance or trust; depend)  [reliable]\nمثال: 私はそのニュースを確かな筋から得た。\n→ I got the news from a reliable source. / [If I'm not mistaken ; If I remember correctly]\nمثال: これは確か淡水魚だと思います。\n→ I believe this fish is a freshwater fish.",
 "たしかなものにする": "قَوَّى, عَزَّزَ (To make strong or stronger; to add strength to; to increase the strength of; to )  [to strengthen]",
