 "たしけし": "أَكِيد (sure, positive, not doubting) / مُتَأَكِّد (sure, positive, not doubting) / بَعْض (not specifically named, indeterminate, indefinite) / مُحَدَّد (Having been determined but not specified.)  [certain]",
 "たしざん": "إضَافَة (The act of adding anything.) / مُضَاف (Anything that is added.) / جَمْع (The arithmetic operation of adding.)  [addition]\nمثال: うちの息子はまだちゃんと足し算ができない。\n→ My boy can't do addition properly yet.",
