 "たすく": "مُسَاعَدَة, مَعُونَة (Action given to provide assistance; aid.) / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (Something or someone which provides assistance with a task.) / سَاعَدَ, عَاوَنَ (To provide assistance to (someone or something).) / مُسَاعَدَة, النَّجْدَة (A cry of distress or an urgent request for assistance.)  [to help]\nمثال: 芸は身を助く。\n→ Accomplishments are a friend in need.",
