 "たまおしこがね": "جَعْل الرَوْث, جِعْرَان (Any of the beetle of the family Scarabaeidae (scarab beetles), especially of the)  [dung beetle]",
 "たまかけ": "مِقْلَاع (An instrument for throwing stones or other missiles, consisting of a short strap) / حَمَّالَة (A kind of hanging bandage put around the neck, in which a wounded arm or hand is)  [slinging (on cranes, etc.)]",
 "たまがけ": "مِقْلَاع (An instrument for throwing stones or other missiles, consisting of a short strap) / حَمَّالَة (A kind of hanging bandage put around the neck, in which a wounded arm or hand is)  [slinging (on cranes, etc.)]",
 "たまがた": "مُسْتَدِير, مُدَوَّر (Of shape:) / مُسْتَدِير, كُرَوِيّ (Of shape:) / دَائِرَة (A circular or spherical object or part of an object.) / جَوْلَة, مَرْحَلَة (One of the specified pre-determined segments of the total time of a sport event,) / دَوْرَة (A stage, level, set of events in a game)  [round]",
 "たまき": "سِوَار (A band or chain worn around the wrist as jewelry/jewellery or an ornament.)  [bracelet (made of stringed jewels or bells and worn at the elbow)] / [bracer (for the elbow of an archer)]",
 "たまきび": "غَلَّة (A single seed of a food crop, especially a cereal grass crop.)  [corn (Zea mays)] / [periwinkle (Littorina brevicula)]",
