 "たまな": "مَلْفُوف, كُرُنْب (An edible plant (Brassica oleracea var. capitata) having a head of green leaves.) / مَلْفُوف, كُرُنْب (The leaves of this plant eaten as a vegetable.)  [cabbage]",
