 "たまもの": "هَدِيَّة, هدية (Something given to another voluntarily, without charge.) / قَرِيحَة (A talent or natural ability.) / أَهْدَى (To give as a gift or donation.)  [gift] / تَسَبَّب (To proceed, spring up or rise, as a consequence, from facts, arguments, premises) / نَتِيجَة (That which results; the conclusion or end to which any course or condition of th)  [(good) result]\nمثال: 今回の成果はひとえに彼の獅子奮迅の働きの賜物でしょう。\n→ Our latest results are the fruit of his furious efforts.",
