 "たみぐさ": "نَاس, خَلْق (plural of person: a body of persons considered generally or collectively; a grou) / خَلْق, شَعْب (Persons forming or belonging to a particular group, such as a nation, class, eth) / أَهْل (A person's ancestors, relatives or family.) / شَعْب (The mass of a community as distinguished from a special class (elite); the commo)  [people]",
