 "ため": "حَسَن, جَيِّد (Of a person or an animal:) / حَسَن, جَيِّد (Of a capability:) / صِحِّيّ (Of a property or quality:) / حَسَنًا (That is good; an elliptical exclamation of satisfaction or commendation.) / خَيْر (The forces or behaviours that are the enemy of evil. Usually consists of helping) / سِلْعَة (An item of merchandise.)  [good]\nمثال: あなたのためなら喜んでどんなことでもします。\n→ I am ready to do anything for you. / غاية, غَرَض (Cause, interest or account.)  [sake]\nمثال: １月３０日、３１日は葬式のため休みます。\n→ I'm taking bereavement leave on Jan. 30 and 31. / عَاقِبَة (that which follows something on which it depends) / نَتِيجَة (that which follows something on which it depends) / عَاقِبَة (result of actions, especially unpleasant)  [consequence]\nمثال: それは、おまえの声をよく聞くためだよ。\n→ It is in order to hear your voice well. / أَثَّرَ (To influence or alter.)  [affecting]",
