 "たもちつづける": "حَافَظَ (To keep up; to preserve; to uphold (a state, condition etc.).)  [to maintain]",
 "たもつ": "اِحْتَفَظَ, أَبْقَى (To hold the status of something.)  [to keep]\nمثال: 体面を保つために行った。\n→ For appearances sake, I went. / آخِر (Final, ultimate, coming after all others of its kind.) / مَاضٍ, الْمَاضِي (Most recent, latest, last so far.) / آخر (after everything else; finally) / اِسْتَمَرَّ, دَامَ (To endure, continue over time.)  [to last]",
 "たもと": "كُمّ, رُدْن (The part of a garment that covers the arm.)  [sleeve (esp. of a kimono)] / قُرْب, جِوَار (Proximity; the state of being near.) / مُحِيط (Neighbourhood; nearby region; surrounding area.)  [vicinity (esp. of a bridge)]\nمثال: 橋のたもとに着いてから橋を渡れ。\n→ Don't cross your bridges before you come to them. / [foot of a mountain ; base of a mountain]",
