 "たゆまぬ": "ثابت (Firm in standing or position; not tottering or shaking; fixed; firm.)  [steady]\nمثال: 諸君らのたゆまぬ努力と労働によって、ついに我らがアジトが完成した！！\n→ Ladies and Gentlemen, thanks to your untiring efforts our hideout is finally complete!! / مُجْتَهِد (Performing with industrious concentration; hard-working and focused.)  [diligent]",
